  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Forge",
    "overview": "A cozy anime blacksmith workshop gives the portfolio its material language: painted timber, amber firelight, cream parchment, brass edging, and the user's orange cat blacksmith. Illustrated objects and the supplied mascot are identity assets; the mascot is preserved as the actual character rather than replaced with a generic illustration.\n\nControls feel like small inventory objects, while readable detail panels feel like pages opened inside the workshop. The dark theme changes those panels to warm leather without recoloring the room artwork or timber navigation. Rounded letters and restrained lift reinforce the friendly, tactile world.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Painted workshop and supplied orange cat mascot.",
      "Timber framing, brass edging, parchment and leather panels.",
      "Baloo 2 headings paired with Nunito reading text.",
      "Illustrated inventory controls with visible labels.",
      "Brief tactile feedback and reduced motion support."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Warm Materials Rule",
        "body": "Theme changes preserve warm brown undertones and amber emphasis.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Rounded Voice Rule",
